 the\ninput ladder.", "originalText": "1. The goal × method Map: one row, a column per registered method,\neach Job with its version, inputs and state; one glance shows the\ninput ladder.", "fontSize": 20, "fontFamily": 6, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "kept_s-c725a01ebe68", "type": "text", "x": 6975.0, "y": 1283.4375, "width": 670.0, "height": 75.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "s-7b1226a74304", "roundness": null, "seed": 1966050773, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1455252480, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "2. The design card read three ways side by side: the SMS on a phone\nwith {LINK} in place, each element with its source, the review and\nexpected range.", "originalText": "2. The design card read three ways side by side: the SMS on a phone\nwith {LINK} in place, each element with its source, the review and\nexpected range.", "fontSize": 20, "fontFamily": 6, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "kept_s-d12e40b1519a", "type": "text", "x": 6975.0, "y": 1375.9375, "width": 690.0, "height": 50.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "s-7b1226a74304", "roundness": null, "seed": 506708404, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 889802533, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "3. Review whole as one plain table (rank · design · predicted · why ·\nkept) with the reviewer's real reasoning.", "originalText": "3. Review whole as one plain table (rank · design · predicted · why ·\nkept) with the reviewer's real reasoning.", "fontSize": 20, "fontFamily": 6, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "kept_s-2f1aba8a1086", "type": "text", "x": 6975.0, "y": 1443.4375, "width": 690.0, "height": 75.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "s-7b1226a74304", "roundness": null, "seed": 545096648, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 30067172, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "4. The Inputs fence table: each part of step ①, its file and sha, and\n'nothing' where a method sees nothing; the M01–M04 ladder is easy to\ncompare.", "originalText": "4. The Inputs fence table: each part of step ①, its file and sha, and\n'nothing' where a method sees nothing; the M01–M04 ladder is easy to\ncompare.", "fontSize": 20, "fontFamily": 6, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "kept_s-ef27a59f0ddd", "type": "text", "x": 6975.0, "y": 1535.9375, "width": 620.0, "height": 50.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "s-7b1226a74304", "roundness": null, "seed": 654124684, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 362930910, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "5. The method view as its five numbered steps, pinned with the\nmethod's sha.", "originalText": "5. The method view as its five numbered steps, pinned with the\nmethod's sha.", "fontSize": 20, "fontFamily": 6, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "kept_s-71e57654070a", "type": "text", "x": 6975.0, "y": 1603.4375, "width": 680.0, "height": 50.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "s-7b1226a74304", "roundness": null, "seed": 1843598834, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1038343910, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "6. One casing for the Job's views (Reason ideas · Conduct & review ·\nReview whole) across Audience Report, Work Details and Runs.", "originalText": "6. One casing for the Job's views (Reason ideas · Conduct & review ·\nReview whole) across Audience Report, Work Details and Runs.", "fontSize": 20, "fontFamily": 6, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "kept_s-5e657bd57bb8", "type": "text", "x": 6975.0, "y": 1670.9375, "width": 630.0, "height": 50.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": "s-7b1226a74304", "roundness": null, "seed": 651243480, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 2078450281, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "7. The Task ▾ menu grouped by step (② · ③ · ⑤), dropped designs\nmarked; each Task tab says 'Task · d04 · name'.", "originalText": "7. The Task ▾ menu grouped by step (② · ③ · ⑤), dropped designs\nmarked; each Task tab says 'Task · d04 · name'.", "fontSize": 20, "fontFamily": 6, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "kept_s-c5063de56052", "type": "text", "x": 6975.0, "y": 1738.4375, "width": 700.0, "height": 50.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "